# libFuzzer-generated corpus entries are content-addressed by SHA1 hash and
# have no extension; hand-authored seeds under corpus_*/ always carry one
# (basic.css, nested.json, ...) so this pattern never touches them.
ci/fuzz/corpus_*/[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]*
